      "message": "I think I did not change the flow, because 2 reasons:\n1. original code does not ensure the order\noriginal order is, first add message `connectAudio ` to statemachine handler, then call `enableSwbCodec`. \nAs statemachine handler thread is different from this thread, the order is uncertain. usually `connectAudio ` will be later\nNow I put setCommunicationDevice into main handler thread, so the result is same. \n\n2. `enableSwbCodec ` is just changing a variable value, https://source.corp.google.com/h/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/bta/ag/bta_ag_swb_aptx.cc;l\u003d73;drc\u003d784c18b551ad67eb711bf139c6a8ecec4febb2de;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1, does not rely on connectAudio",
